3337840/extras/9e12ed79866aff3ba0d738b1c9c17c52.webp?t=1750021980\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/f617433b70d3bdbcea0a5f72dd53ed8e.poster.avif?t=1750021980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/f617433b70d3bdbcea0a5f72dd53ed8e.webm?t=1750021980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f Experience <strong>7 unique stages</strong>, each with their own gimmicks and bosses to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f Enjoy a beautiful <strong>17-track OST</strong> composed by Princess Sylvysprit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f Uncover <strong>a tragic story</strong> <strong>about acceptance</strong> through <strong>expressive characters and dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f\u00a0Record and re-watch your playthroughs with <strong>replays</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f\u00a0Hone your skills with an <strong>in-depth practice mode</strong> <i>(which hides a few secrets...)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f Learn more about the bosses you've defeated in <strong>an unlockable bestiary</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u273f ... <strong>And more!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy mode, which is perfect for those new to the genre</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam